{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】解放軍暫停順豐速運的採購參與資格。</p>\n<p>解放軍周六發布軍隊採購暫停名單，當中包括順豐速運及八馬茶業，指他們存在違規問題，被暫停參加全軍物資、工程和服務採購活動，但無說明詳情及暫停期限。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:43:53.601169+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:20:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:29.252714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:25.718438+00:00","content_hash":"edc9f7dcd08b1d75977a18b3304f150f95625a927feffeef358949e3f5a96a84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}